        <section id="classes" >
          
            <h2>Classes</h2>
              <p>A Class is a ‘blueprint’ that defines the attributes and methods common to all objects of this kind (e.g. dog or car).</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token operator">&lt;</span><span class="token class-name">Access</span><span class="token operator">-</span><span class="token class-name">Modifier</span><span class="token operator">></span> <span class="token keyword">class</span> <span class="token class-name">MyClass</span> </span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span> </span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token comment">// attribute, constructor, getter/setter </span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  and behavioural method declarations </span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="instantiate-an-object" >
          
            <h2>Instantiate an Object</h2>
              <p>To instantiate (create (in memory)) an Object from a Class:</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token class-name">MyClass</span> instance <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">new</span> <span class="token class-name">MyClass</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token generics"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;</span>constructor parameters<span class="token punctuation">></span></span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
              <p>We can instantiate an infinite number of objects from a class (i.e. multiple different cars, dogs, people etc.).</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
